.TH REMOTERIG-CLIENT-QML 1 "September 2026" "RemoteRig 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
remoterig\-client\-qml \- touch interface for a remote amateur radio transceiver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B remoterig\-client\-qml
.SH DESCRIPTION
The same client as
.BR remoterig-client (1),
with an interface built for a finger rather than a mouse: the transmit button
takes the bottom of the screen, and the settings live in a drawer.
.PP
It is the interface shipped on Android. On the desktop it serves to judge the
layout without a phone.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/F4JTV/RemoteRigClient.conf
Shared with the desktop client.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR remoterig-client (1),
.BR remoterig-server (1)
